{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 57,
  "name": "巽为风",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07844",
              "text": "巽。小亨。利有攸往，利见大人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07844",
                "bodyParagraph": 7780
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07845",
              "text": "象曰：随风，巽。君子以申命行事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07845",
                "bodyParagraph": 7781
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07847",
              "text": "巽卦：稍见亨通。利于出行，利于会见王公贵族。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07847",
                "bodyParagraph": 7783
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07848",
              "text": "《象辞》说：本卦为巽卦相迭而成，巽为风，因而长风相随，吹拂不断，是巽卦的卦象。君子观此卦象，取法于长吹不断的风，从而不断地申明教义，反复地颁行政令，灌输纲常大义。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07848",
                "bodyParagraph": 7784
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07850",
              "text": "巽卦巽上巽下，为巽宫本位卦。巽为顺，谦逊、顺从之意，对君子有利，利见大人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07850",
                "bodyParagraph": 7786
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07852",
              "text": "顺伏容人，谦虚行事；得贵多助，利在远处。 得此卦者，运势起伏不定，宜随机应变，谦虚行事，则可得意外之收获。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07852",
                "bodyParagraph": 7788
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07854",
              "text": "时运：运势顺利，诸事皆宜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07854",
                "bodyParagraph": 7790
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07855",
              "text": "财运：随机应变，获利可期。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07855",
                "bodyParagraph": 7791
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07856",
              "text": "家宅：可以安居；夫唱妇随。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07856",
                "bodyParagraph": 7792
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07857",
              "text": "身体：可能中风，须人扶行。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07857",
                "bodyParagraph": 7793
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07859",
              "text": "这个卦是同卦（下巽上巽）相叠，巽为风，两风相重，长风不绝，无孔不入，巽亦为顺、谦逊的态度和行为，可无往不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07859",
                "bodyParagraph": 7795
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07860",
              "text": "大象：此卦为两重巽风重叠，巽为入，风之所到无孔不入，尤如政令颁布，深入民心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07860",
                "bodyParagraph": 7796
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07861",
              "text": "运势：波折重重，运势起落浮沉不定，要随机应变，心平气和，择善固执。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07861",
                "bodyParagraph": 7797
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07862",
              "text": "事业：正在发展中，应本着勇往直前的精神，战胜一切困难和险阻，奋发向上。万事起头难，开始会受挫折，但在有才德和有力量的人物帮助下，会有理想的结果。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07862",
                "bodyParagraph": 7798
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07863",
              "text": "经商：市场竞争激烈，风险大。商业活动务必小心谨慎，遵守商业道德，以谦逊的态度对待同行和顾客，及至竞争对手，必定可以取得利益。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07863",
                "bodyParagraph": 7799
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07864",
              "text": "求名：以谦逊的态度对待一切，但又不可自卑、软弱、做作，更不可虚伪，这样就可以进步很快。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07864",
                "bodyParagraph": 7800
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07865",
              "text": "婚恋：不可抱轻率的态度，而应慎重，相互尊重。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07865",
                "bodyParagraph": 7801
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07866",
              "text": "决策：头脑聪明、灵活，性格开朗，以谦虚的态度处世，会受到各个方面的欢迎，也会得到上级的重视。谦虚不可过度，应以刚健中正为前提，决不可表现为懦弱和虚伪。否则，不利于自身的成长。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07866",
                "bodyParagraph": 7802
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07868",
              "text": "巽为风，八卦中巽的符号为“”。八卦中巽卦的符号的产生，是古人在生产实践中，看到大雨即将来临之前，往往有大风刮来。就在这山雨欲来风满楼的时刻，天空中有着一层又一层厚厚实实的乌云在翻滚，云下又有着一股接一股的风在吹动。于是用“二”代表那一层又一层的乌云，而以“--”代表云层之下一股又一股的风。合在一起，形成了“”这样的符号，以象征风。巽卦初爻为阴爻，二阳爻在上。巽由乾卦初爻变阴而来，乾为金玉，故作生意能获三倍巨利。巽为震的旁通卦，震阳决躁，故为躁卦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07868",
                "bodyParagraph": 7804
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07869",
              "text": "由巽卦卦象、爻象、爻位还可悟出如下象意：外刚内柔、整齐、传达、生意、营利、无孔不入、钻空子、新鲜、言语、捷报、举荐、奔波、薄情、忧疑、烦躁、权谋、不果断等。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07869",
                "bodyParagraph": 7805
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07872",
              "text": "初六。进退，利武人之贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07872",
                "bodyParagraph": 7808
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07873",
              "text": "象曰：进退，志疑也。利武人之贞，志治也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07873",
                "bodyParagraph": 7809
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07875",
              "text": "初六：进退听命，这是利于武人的占卜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07875",
                "bodyParagraph": 7811
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07876",
              "text": "《象辞》说：进退听命，是因为自己没有成见。武人具有坚定的意志是应该的，因为只有意志坚定，才能勇敢无畏，临危不乱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07876",
                "bodyParagraph": 7812
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07878",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，有得有失，不良者多招诽谤。做官的或有差役，进退不一，或有兼权，难中有易。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07878",
                "bodyParagraph": 7814
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07880",
              "text": "时运：谋事不成，考虑从军。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07880",
                "bodyParagraph": 7816
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07881",
              "text": "财运：犹豫不决，无利可图。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07881",
                "bodyParagraph": 7817
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07882",
              "text": "家宅：朝西有利；联姻军人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07882",
                "bodyParagraph": 7818
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07883",
              "text": "身体：积极强身。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07883",
                "bodyParagraph": 7819
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07885",
              "text": "初六爻动变得周易第9卦：风天小畜。这个卦是异卦（下乾上巽）相叠，乾为天，巽为风。喻风调雨顺，谷物滋长，故卦名小畜（蓄）。力量有限，须待发展到一定程度，才可大有作为。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07885",
                "bodyParagraph": 7821
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "九二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07888",
              "text": "九二。巽在床下，用史巫纷若，吉，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07888",
                "bodyParagraph": 7824
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07889",
              "text": "象曰：纷若之吉，得中也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07889",
                "bodyParagraph": 7825
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07891",
              "text": "九二：病人卧床不起，祝史巫士降神祭祀，禳灾驱鬼，忙碌不停。病情有好转，灾难消除了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07891",
                "bodyParagraph": 7827
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07892",
              "text": "《象辞》说：祝史巫士禳灾驱鬼忙碌不停，之所以使病情有好转，因为九二阳爻居下卦中位，爻象既得，灾难自退。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07892",
                "bodyParagraph": 7828
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07894",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，诚恳待人，谋望获利。做官的有升迁之机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07894",
                "bodyParagraph": 7830
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07896",
              "text": "时运：神明保佑，运途顺利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07896",
                "bodyParagraph": 7832
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07897",
              "text": "财运：买卖难决，最好占筮。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07897",
                "bodyParagraph": 7833
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07898",
              "text": "家宅：虔诚祷告；卜之则吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07898",
                "bodyParagraph": 7834
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07899",
              "text": "身体：祭拜免咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07899",
                "bodyParagraph": 7835
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07901",
              "text": "九二爻动变得周易第53卦：风山渐。这个卦是异卦（下艮上巽）相叠。艮为山，巽为木。山上有木，逐渐成长，山也随着增高。这是逐渐进步的过程，所以称渐，渐即进，渐渐前进而不急速。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07901",
                "bodyParagraph": 7837
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07904",
              "text": "九三。频巽，吝。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07904",
                "bodyParagraph": 7840
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07905",
              "text": "象曰：频巽之吝，志穷也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07905",
                "bodyParagraph": 7841
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07907",
              "text": "九三：勉强顺从，其心必不顺畅。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07907",
                "bodyParagraph": 7843
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07908",
              "text": "《象辞》说：勉强顺从，而内心不顺畅，说明这是出于无可奈何。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07908",
                "bodyParagraph": 7844
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07910",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，运势低迷，有穷困之厄。做官的有被贬职之忧。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07910",
                "bodyParagraph": 7846
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07912",
              "text": "时运：位卑志低，受人轻视。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07912",
                "bodyParagraph": 7848
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07913",
              "text": "财运：过于卑顺，如何争利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07913",
                "bodyParagraph": 7849
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07914",
              "text": "家宅：贫穷之家；门户低微。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07914",
                "bodyParagraph": 7850
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07915",
              "text": "身体：太过疲弱。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07915",
                "bodyParagraph": 7851
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07917",
              "text": "九三爻动变得周易第59卦：风水涣。这个卦是异卦（下坎上巽）相叠。风在水上行，推波助澜，四方流溢。涣，水流流散之意。象征组织和人心涣散，必须用积极的手段和方法克服，战胜弊端，挽救涣散，转危为安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07917",
                "bodyParagraph": 7853
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "六四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07920",
              "text": "六四。悔亡，田获三品。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07920",
                "bodyParagraph": 7856
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07921",
              "text": "象曰：田获三品，有功也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07921",
                "bodyParagraph": 7857
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07923",
              "text": "六四：没有悔恨，狩猎获得各种猎物。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07923",
                "bodyParagraph": 7859
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07924",
              "text": "《象辞》说：狩猎获得各种猎物，说明狩猎大有收获。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07924",
                "bodyParagraph": 7860
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07926",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，正当好运，多福多利。读书人会取得佳绩。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07926",
                "bodyParagraph": 7862
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07928",
              "text": "时运：走上正运，出而有功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07928",
                "bodyParagraph": 7864
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07929",
              "text": "财运：皮革羽毛，皆可致富。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07929",
                "bodyParagraph": 7865
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07930",
              "text": "家宅：装潢美观；婚礼华丽。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07930",
                "bodyParagraph": 7866
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07931",
              "text": "身体：可以痊愈。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07931",
                "bodyParagraph": 7867
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07933",
              "text": "六四爻动变得周易第44卦：天风姤。这个卦是异卦（下巽上乾）相叠。乾为天，巽为风。天下有风，吹遍大地，阴阳交合，万物茂盛。姤（gǒu）卦与夬卦相反，互为“综卦”。姤即媾，阴阳相遇。但五阳一阴，不能长久相处。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07933",
                "bodyParagraph": 7869
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07936",
              "text": "九五。贞吉，悔亡，无不利。无初有终。先庚三日，后庚三日，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07936",
                "bodyParagraph": 7872
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07937",
              "text": "象曰：九五之吉，位中正也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07937",
                "bodyParagraph": 7873
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07939",
              "text": "九五：贞卜得吉兆，没有悔恨，无所不利。虽没有良好的开端，但有良好的结局。时日定在丁日或癸日，其事一定成功。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07939",
                "bodyParagraph": 7875
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07940",
              "text": "《象辞》说：",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07940",
                "bodyParagraph": 7876
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07942",
              "text": "之所以讲吉利，因为九五阳爻居上卦中位，像人事合于正道，自然吉利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07942",
                "bodyParagraph": 7878
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07944",
              "text": "吉：得此爻者，谋望有成，无往不利。做官的先阻后顺。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07944",
                "bodyParagraph": 7880
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07946",
              "text": "时运：中正之位，无往不利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07946",
                "bodyParagraph": 7882
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07947",
              "text": "财运：初有小悔，后得大利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07947",
                "bodyParagraph": 7883
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07948",
              "text": "家宅：坐北朝南；相配得宜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07948",
                "bodyParagraph": 7884
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07949",
              "text": "身体：三日可愈。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07949",
                "bodyParagraph": 7885
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07951",
              "text": "九五爻动变得周易第18卦：山风蛊。这个卦是异卦（下巽上艮）相叠，与随卦互为综卦。蛊本意为事，引申为多事、混乱。器皿久不用而生虫称“蛊”，喻天下久安而因循、腐败，必须革新创造，治理整顿，挽救危机，重振事业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07951",
                "bodyParagraph": 7887
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07954",
              "text": "上九。巽在床下，丧其资斧，贞凶。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07954",
                "bodyParagraph": 7890
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07955",
              "text": "象曰：巽在床下，上穷也；丧其资斧，正乎凶也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07955",
                "bodyParagraph": 7891
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07957",
              "text": "上九：人隐伏在床底下，钱财则被洗劫一空。卜问得凶兆。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07957",
                "bodyParagraph": 7893
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07958",
              "text": "《象辞》说：隐伏在床底下，正是上九阳爻穷途末路之象。钱财被洗劫，不正是凶险之事吗？",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07958",
                "bodyParagraph": 7894
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07960",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，多损失，或生疾病。做官的有运不逢时，须谨慎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07960",
                "bodyParagraph": 7896
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07962",
              "text": "时运：越高越危，有失无得。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07962",
                "bodyParagraph": 7898
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07963",
              "text": "财运：因循失利，损耗不小。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07963",
                "bodyParagraph": 7899
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07964",
              "text": "家宅：有丧；惧内。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07964",
                "bodyParagraph": 7900
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07965",
              "text": "身体：或许告终。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07965",
                "bodyParagraph": 7901
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07967",
              "text": "上九爻动变得周易第48卦：水风井。这个卦是异卦（下巽上坎）相叠。坎为水；巽为木。树木得水而蓬勃生长。人靠水井生活，水井由人挖掘而成。相互为养，井以水养人，经久不竭，人应取此德而勤劳自勉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07967",
                "bodyParagraph": 7903
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
